      "categoryID": 3,
      "benefits": "Small experimental human studies reported increased skin pigmentation and initiation of erections. The tanning study included only three volunteers, and the erectile-function crossover study included ten men. These findings are preliminary, do not establish safe cosmetic use, and do not demonstrate sun protection or a broad sexual-health benefit."
    }
